      "updated": 1788726884043,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Delivery layer: \n\nVisitor → ALB → (Catalog service / Cart service), \neach in private subnets, each with its own database.\n\nService-to-service layer: \n\nCart → Service Connect → Catalog (this is internal).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Delivery layer: \n\nVisitor → ALB → (Catalog service / Cart service), \neach in private subnets, each with its own database.\n\nService-to-service layer: \n\nCart → Service Connect → Catalog (this is internal).",
